ulate the derivatives of the components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\, & {y}^{′}(t) & =1 \\\\ {x}^{″}(t) & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\, & {y}^{″}(t) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting these into the formula for the curvature, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(t) & =\\frac{|(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\cdot 0-(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)\\cdot 1|}{{((\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)^{2}+{1}^{2})}^{3/2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\operatorname{cos}⁡t|}{{({sin}^{2}⁡t+1)}^{3/2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t}{\\sqrt{{({sin}^{2}⁡t+1)}^{3}}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that we removed the absolute value because cosine is positive for $t\\in [0,\\frac{\\pi }{2}].$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399405 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399406 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399405 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399407 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399405 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399408 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399405 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399409 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399405 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399410 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399405 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399405 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399405 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399406 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399405 1080 #uuid "b978e6f7-e64f-5b80-8951-81925452e0ed" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399406 1081 "\\sqrt{{({sin}^{2}⁡t+1)}^{3}}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399406 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399406 1084 #uuid "78fb291c-c31f-5ac0-9d77-7a2e07aadd0d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399407 1081 "\\sqrt{({sin}^{2}⁡t+1)}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399407 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399407 1084 #uuid "2bc16458-ce9f-50c1-8fbf-48870b72fe4c" 13194139533478 175921860