 following:\n\n$$\nψ(x,y)={x}^{2}{y}^{2}+f(x),\\,ψ(x,y)={x}^{2}{y}^{2}+g(y)\n$$\n\nwhere $f$ and $g$ are arbitrary functions. Finally, setting $f=g=0,$ we have\n\n$$\nψ(x,y)={x}^{2}{y}^{2}=(xy)^{2}.\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399419 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399420 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399419 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399421 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399419 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399422 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399419 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399423 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399419 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399424 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399419 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399419 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399419 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399421 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399419 1080 #uuid "5c61b134-7c57-530f-8b97-97a808179f81" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399420 1081 "ψ(x,y)=(x-y)^{2}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399420 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399420 1084 #uuid "fc634ad5-e010-5c6c-accf-cdd1bfc87d09" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399421 1081 "ψ(x,y)=(xy)^{2}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399421 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399421 1084 #uuid "4ee290fe-8425-5228-94c2-57bd0a2da175" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399422 1081 "ψ(x,y)={x}^{2}{y}^{3}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399422 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399422 1084 #uuid "726bbe70-cba3-547c-bf90-2310b15873c6" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399423 1081 "ψ(x,y)=(x+y)^{2}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399423 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399423 1084 #uuid "9a3e8097-9217-5fb9-b7d3-fa8eb7bed46e" 13194139533478 175