074 "Recall that the equation of an ellipsoid centered at $O$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1,\n$$\n\nand an ellipsoid centered at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-{x}_{0})^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-{y}_{0})^{2}}{{b}^{2}}+\\frac{(z-{z}_{0})^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1,\n$$\n\nThus, our equation is an ellipsoid with the following parameters:\n\n$$\n({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})=(1,-2,0),\\,a=3,\\,b=\\sqrt{7},\\,c=2.\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399543 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399544 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399543 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399545 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399543 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399546 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399543 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399547 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399543 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399548 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399543 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399543 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399543 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399548 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399543 1080 #uuid "903d6dd5-4634-519d-8334-fc52eabb5e80" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399544 1081 "A paraboloid" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399544 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399544 1084 #uuid "91eeb41c-1501-568e-81cf-b44bd4f6787f" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399545 1081 "A cylinder" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399545 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399545 1084 #uuid "2b39f102-3558-5351-90f8-01a7c7dbb286" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399546 1081 "A hyperboloid" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399546 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399546 1084 #uuid "9d64cbe0-4403-549f-94d2-cf3c73ceb779" 1319