] [17592186399598 1074 "Remember that the equation of an ellipse centered at the origin with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn the given equation, we have ${a}^{2}=1$ and ${b}^{2}=8.$\n\n- Since ${a}^{2}=1,$ the length of the horizontal radius must be $a=\\sqrt{1}=1.$\n\n- Since ${b}^{2}=8,$ the length of the vertical radius must be $b=\\sqrt{8}=2\\sqrt{2}.$\n\nSo the semi-major axis has length $b=2\\sqrt{2},$ and the semi-minor axis has length $a=1.$\n\nTherefore, the major axis has length $2b=2\\cdot 2\\sqrt{2}=4\\sqrt{2},$ and the minor axis has length $2a=2\\cdot 1=2.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399600 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399601 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399602 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399603 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399599 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399604 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399599 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399599 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399599 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399602 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399599 1080 #uuid "b41dd28d-0ca0-5222-9cfe-700ddaa37f17" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399600 1081 "$8$ and $1$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399600 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399600 1084 #uuid "755a881c-6b14-5e96-bd68-6af58d5ef813" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399601 1081 "$2\\sqrt{2}$ and $1$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399601 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399601 1084 #uuid "5965e390-56a0-55ef-a7dc-eff34c09cc53" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1081 "$4\\sqrt{2}$ and $2$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1084 #uuid "1f629da2-c549-5180-8903-3a78b8767616" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1081 "$4$ and $2$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1084 #uuid "1c1fc5c2-bdfa-52e9-a59e-c6227d171448" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1081 "$2\\sqrt{2}$ and $2$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1084 #uuid "47a16fa9-9d49-55d0-a143-c2b6cca5c4dc" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399606 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1069 "q-164553" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1071 "Identify the surface $5{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-5{z}^{2}+20x+10z+15=0.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1072 #uuid "040e9acf-1af9-5813-86f6-e469cb0eecc9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1074 "First, we complete the square in the $x$ and $z$ terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-5{z}^{2}+20x+10z+15 & =0 \\\\ 5({x}^{2}+4x)-{y}^{2}-5({z}^{2}-2z)+15 & =0 \\\\ 5[(x+2)^{2}-4]-{y}^{2}-5[(z-1)^{2}-1]+15 & =0 \\\\ 5(x+2)^{2}-20-{y}^{2}-5(z-1)^{2}+5+15 & =0 \\\\ 5(x+2)^{2}-{y}^{2}-5(z-1)^{2} & =0 \\\\ -5(x+2)^{2}+{y}^{2}+5(z-1)^{2} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of an elliptic cone centered at $(-2,0,1).$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399606 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399607 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399606 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399608 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399606 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399609 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399606 1075 #edb/ref 175